  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> mà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⊂</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Xét <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, ta có\n\t\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông cân tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó, diện tích <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Thể tích của khối chóp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/7d4cd6adfbb1b71be2c8723e0774c1251ba07c9cef06fe9a7587c9ec5ee18f5a.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
